(CODENAMES - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Two teams, red and blue, compete to find their secret agents first. Each team has a) Tj T*
(spymaster who knows which words belong to which team and gives one-word clues.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(Lay out 25 word cards in a 5 x 5 grid. The spymasters sit on the same side and draw a) Tj T*
(key card that shows the secret identity of each word: 9 agents for the starting team,) Tj T*
(8 for the other team, 7 innocent bystanders and 1 assassin. The light on the key card) Tj T*
(shows which team starts.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(GIVING A CLUE) Tj T*
(The spymaster says one word and one number, for example "Fruit: 3". The word is a hint) Tj T*
(about the meaning of the agents; the number says how many agents are related to it.) Tj T*
(- The clue must be about meaning, not about letters or position on the table.) Tj T*
(- You may not say a word that is visible on the table, or part of one.) Tj T*
(- Spymasters keep a straight face and do not gesture.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
