(GUESSING) Tj T*
(The team discusses and touches one card. The spymaster covers it with the matching) Tj T*
(card:) Tj T*
(- Own agent: the team may guess again.) Tj T*
(- Bystander: the turn ends.) Tj T*
(- Other team's agent: the turn ends and that agent counts for the other team.) Tj T*
(- Assassin: the team loses the game immediately.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The team may make as many guesses as the number in the clue plus one extra guess. A) Tj T*
(team may always stop guessing after its first correct guess.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLUE OF ZERO) Tj T*
(A spymaster may say "zero" or "unlimited" as the number. With zero, the team may guess) Tj T*
(as many times as it wants and the clue tells them which words to avoid.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(WINNING) Tj T*
(The first team to cover all of its agents wins. A team also wins if the other team) Tj T*
(touches the assassin.) Tj T*
ET
